[0.503, "o", "$ python examples/demo.py\r\n"]
[0.505, "o", "# Two gated tool calls through the LangChain adapter: one approved, one denied\r\n\r\n"]
[1.005, "o", ">>> policy.register_action('check_loan_eligibility', 'irreversible_financial')\r\n"]
[1.008, "o", "    (no default allowed here — this must be declared explicitly)\r\n\r\n"]
[1.204, "o", ">>> SCENARIO 1: a legitimate applicant\r\n\r\n"]
[0.910, "o", ">>> agent calls check_loan_eligibility('A123')...\r\n"]
[0.927, "o", "  >> GATE TRIGGERED: 'check_loan_eligibility' classified as high risk\r\n"]
[1.205, "o", "     routing to compliance_officer for approval...\r\n"]
[1.305, "o", "     compliance_officer: reviewing applicant A123's request...\r\n"]
[1.303, "o", "     compliance_officer: APPROVED\r\n\r\n"]
[1.109, "o", "<<< tool result: Applicant A123: eligible\r\n\r\n"]
[1.201, "o", ">>> audit record written (append-only, Art. 12):\r\n"]
[1.002, "o", "    action=check_loan_eligibility  risk_tier=high  confidence=1.0\r\n"]
[1.005, "o", "    exposure_class=irreversible_financial\r\n"]
[1.005, "o", "    approver=compliance_officer  approved=True\r\n\r\n"]
[1.505, "o", ">>> SCENARIO 2: a flagged applicant\r\n\r\n"]
[0.905, "o", ">>> agent calls check_loan_eligibility('B456')...\r\n"]
[0.903, "o", "    (LangChain logs a warning below when the callback raises — that's the\r\n"]
[0.903, "o", "     denial genuinely propagating through LangChain's own internals)\r\n"]
[1.203, "o", "  >> GATE TRIGGERED: 'check_loan_eligibility' classified as high risk\r\n"]
[1.203, "o", "     routing to compliance_officer for approval...\r\n"]
[1.305, "o", "     compliance_officer: reviewing applicant B456's request...\r\n"]
[1.301, "o", "     compliance_officer: applicant ID does not match records on file\r\n"]
[1.304, "o", "     compliance_officer: DENIED\r\n\r\n"]
[1.110, "o", "Error in AIActGuardCallbackHandler.on_tool_start callback: ApprovalRequired(\"Action 'check_loan_eligibility' (category=essential_services, risk_tier=high) was denied: Applicant ID does not match records on file.\")\r\n<<< BLOCKED — the tool call never executed\r\n\r\n"]
[1.406, "o", ">>> audit record for the blocked attempt:\r\n"]
[1.003, "o", "    action=check_loan_eligibility  approved=False\r\n"]
[1.001, "o", "    approver=compliance_officer\r\n"]
[1.005, "o", "    reason=Applicant ID does not match records on file.\r\n\r\n"]
[1.605, "o", ">>> generating a conformity readiness checklist from this audit trail...\r\n\r\n"]
[1.106, "o", "# Conformity readiness checklist (pre-assessment aid)\r\n\r\n> This is a gap-analysis against logged evidence, not a conformity assessment — it doesn't determine whether the system actually conforms, only whether the supporting evidence this generator can see is in place.\r\n\r\n- [x] **Audit trail covers logged actions** (Art. 12) — 2 action(s) logged\r\n- [x] **Risk classification applied to high-risk actions** (Art. 6, Annex III) — Risk tiers observed: high\r\n- [x] **Human oversight gates configured for high-risk actions** (Art. 14) — 2 gated action(s) logged\r\n- [x] **Override decisions carry a recorded reason** (Art. 14) — 0 override(s) logged\r\n- [x] **System description documented** (Annex IV) — Provided via questionnaire\r\n- [x] **Data governance summary documented** (Annex IV) — Provided via questionnaire\r\n- [ ] **Post-market monitoring plan drafted** (Art. 72) — Run generate_post_market_monitoring_plan() and confirm here\r\n- [ ] **Fundamental Rights Impact Assessment drafted (if applicable)** (Art."]
[0.000, "o", " 27) — Run generate_fria() if this system is a banking/insurance/public-service deployer\r\n\r\n**2 gap(s) found** — see unchecked items above."]
